-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157144","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Nimo","creatorId":"vndb:s21246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21246","name":"Nimo","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:157145","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87452","characterName":"其扇 晟尋","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87452"},"originalCharacterName":"其扇 晟尋","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"408"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"178"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A young, second-term member of the House of Representatives. Favored by Taichiro Hareyama, Minister of Justice and head of the Seiran faction."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Attended an all-boys integrated junior and senior high school in Kyoto, then went on to Kyoto Imperial University’s Faculty of Law. After one year working at a bank, he soon ran for the House of Representatives."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"With both a striking appearance and a prestigious background—not to mention strong leadership skills—he has become a popular politician despite his youth. Having grown up watching his parents’ cold, loveless marriage, he has little hope or interest in marrying himself."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87452"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/54/54d85d1102c2eabc90cb4e8cfb85093d6c15e5e2a11dd63640caf4779ef8a7ea.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b36b47d4f1ca2f940d525acf0be7f6533c3f2ba1f1bfa3bbbf9c374202535e09.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"宮尾 章","creatorId":"vndb:s20397","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s20397","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s20397","name":"水中 雅章","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81298","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87453","characterName":"蓼丸 一貴","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87453"},"originalCharacterName":"蓼丸 一貴","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"29"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"823"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"183"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Sonogi’s personal secretary. The son of a prominent opposition party lawmaker, he once aspired to be a politician himself. After meeting Sonogi and recognizing his potential, he decided to support him as his secretary."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Skipped a year of college in the U.S., where he polished his academics, language skills, and personal network."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because he joined the ruling party alongside Sonogi, his father disowned him. While some within the ruling party are suspicious of an opposition lawmaker’s son serving a ruling party politician, the arrangement has ironically boosted his popularity among the public."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Never without his phone."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87453"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c0cb1b64c1f9726a6109c26db017286db00326df337c58e1e9d2cf4d19af21b5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0d/0de58427e27ae4f09de943b8c92ce41821bf2872c93d07bc6584ca21521eed3b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天河 雄成","creatorId":"vndb:s21952","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s21952","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s21952","name":"天河 雄成","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:81296","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87455","characterName":"東郷 遊馬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87455"},"originalCharacterName":"東郷 遊馬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"33"},"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"101"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"186"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The third son of the influential Tougou family. After graduating from university, he joined a major company owned by his father. Talented and quick to stand out, he now serves as the company’s Head of Sales at the main office."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He inherited the role of supporting Sonogi from his father, but his sharp business acumen means he tends to look down on the younger politician. Their first meeting went badly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Because his company is a sponsor of the 2020 International Athlete Festival (IAF), he has taken a hardline stance, insisting the terrorist threat must be stopped at all costs."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official website."}],"source":"vndb","sour